    given-names: Aisulu
keywords:
  - drift-diffusion model
  - evidence accumulation
  - language model reasoning
  - answer-key deference
  - AI safety evaluation
abstract: >-
  Drift-diffusion (HSSM) fits to a reasoning model's answers and reasoning-token counts, and a series of
  pre-registered experiments on whether a planted answer key acts as a prior or as evidence in DeepSeek-R1-0528,
  Qwen3-32B and gpt-oss-120b, including an activation probe across the reasoning trace of Qwen3-32B.
  Built during the BlueDot Impact Technical AI Safety Project (TAISP) programme, 2026.
